    RP2354A: an RP2350A with 2 MB flash stacked in the package on the QSPI bus; the QSPI data pins stay open.                                         |                        |              |  GND  |
    C3..C8 decouple the six IOVDD pins, C9 USB_OTP_VDD and QSPI_IOVDD, C10 ADC_AVDD, C11 VREG_VIN.                                                    |                        |              +-------+
    Core regulator per RP2350 data sheet 6.3.8: C12 is COUT, C36 sits at DVDD pin 23, C13 and C14 at pins 6 and 39.                                   |                        |                 2|
    L1 is polarity marked: its dot (pin 1) goes on +1V1. VREG_AVDD is filtered by R27 and C17.                                                        |                  USB_DP|52---[USB_DP]     |
